member.summary:
Shows a report on the page (all sheets as tabs) with a download button:
@await Component.InvokeAsync("KscExcelViewer", new { template = "Invoice", data = Model, downloadName = "invoice" })
or <vc:ksc-excel-viewer template="Invoice" data="Model" />.

Shows a report as a PDF on the page (browser PDF reader: pages, zoom, search, print) with Download / Print buttons:
@await Component.InvokeAsync("KscPdfViewer", new { template = "Invoice", data = Model, downloadName = "invoice" })
Requires o.UsePdf() (KSC.Excel.Pdf) and app.MapKscExcelDownloads().
